  "text": "About us\nProjects\nTeam\nCompetitions\nSponsor us\nJoin Marinor\nMARINOR NTNU · SEASON 2025\nTeam 2025\n\nThe students who started Marinor NTNU and built Argus.\n\nOur groups\nLeader\n1 MEMBER\nKasper Tufte Langland\nPerception\n5 MEMBERS\nEmil Gaustad\nJohannes Embretsen Gunnarshaug\nKasper Tufte Langland\nSåvi Midtveit\nEmil Mohr-Skogan\nAutonomy\n4 MEMBERS\nOskar Fredrik Eliassen\nVegard Hovstad\nMagnus Skourup Rognebakke\nMatteo Bonora Sevenius\nControl\nControl\n2 MEMBERS\nSigurd Werner Aatsæther\nPeder Aasmundtveit Hoff\nGUI\n2 MEMBERS\nEmil Sørgaard Djupvik\nAslak Myhre\nHardware\n5 MEMBERS\nAre Odberg Algrøy\nJacob Hansson\nMagnus Kalvenes\nGardar Benneche Skansbo\nPaul Johan Slungård\nEconomy\n1 MEMBER\nJonas Aanensen\nPR\n1 MEMBER\nMarte Madslien Bakken\nWant to join the team?\n\nWe need students in robotics, automation, marine technology and other subjects.\n\nJoin Marinor\n\nA student organisation at NTNU in Trondheim that builds autonomous boats.\n\nmarinorntnu@gmail.com\nCopy\nHøgskoleringen 1\n7034 Trondheim\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nMARINOR\nHome\nAbout us\nTeam\nCompetitions\nOUR WORK\nArgus\nProteus\nNjord Challenge\nRoboBoat\nGET INVOLVED\nJoin the crew\nSponsor us\nEmail us\n© 2026 Marinor NTNU\nOrg.nr. 936 064 809\nBack to top",
